# tier 3's 2d-640x480-frit set: the guest's DejaVu Sans Mono, generated at
# run time (ADR-1301 D2). It states no cell=, so it draws in its outline
# font's own cell, 9x16 at 16 pixels (ADR-1200 D17); the built-in unifont
# draws what it lacks (#141).
source=outline:/usr/share/fonts/TTF/DejaVuSansMono.ttf
